asier to find using treasure maps and compasses.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915660/extras/f27a4532948fb9e2dbb7586bcb031e45.poster.avif?t=1754710832\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915660/extras/f27a4532948fb9e2dbb7586bcb031e45.webm?t=1754710832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915660/extras/f27a4532948fb9e2dbb7586bcb031e45.mp4?t=1754710832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Playstyle</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic single-player campaign: 21 campaign maps with randomly generated elements, allowing players to configure alliances and various parameters;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge campaign: 6 challenge maps, multiple difficulty levels and 17 treaties to test your limits; Story campaign: become the Elf\u00a0Prince Serlin\u00a0or an Eternight Council\u00a0vanguard, leading your alignment\u00a0to victory;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple multiplayer modes: cooperate or compete online in the lobby, hotseat mode supports up to 8 players on the same device;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic Hero Battle: save your developed troop\u00a0from campaigns to participate in tournament matches for rankings and rewards;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map editor: built-in map editor and random map template editor, with sharing available via the creative workshop.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915660/extras/f195894c0a157d57eddbd5a703fa5f65.poster.avif?t=1754710832\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915660/extras/f195894c0a157d57eddbd5a703fa5f65.webm?t=1754710832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915660/extras/f195894c0a157d57eddbd5a703fa5f65.mp4?t=1754710832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
